WEBVTT

00:00:57.214 --> 00:01:00.862
"Yolg'izlikning yuz yili" nima uchun
bu qadar mashhur?

00:01:00.862 --> 00:01:03.841
Roman Buendiya oilasining 
yetti avlodi boshidan kechirgan

00:01:03.841 --> 00:01:07.584
shirin va achchiq qismati yilnomasidir.

00:01:07.584 --> 00:01:10.461
O'zining go'zal, 
mufassal jumlalari,

00:01:10.461 --> 00:01:14.116
ko'p sonli qahramonlari va

00:01:14.116 --> 00:01:17.120
chigal hikoya ususli bilan

00:01:17.120 --> 00:01:21.512
"Yolg'izlikning yuz yili" ni
mutolaa uchun yengil kitob deb bo'lmaydi.

00:01:21.512 --> 00:01:23.740
Ammo qizg'in ishqiy munosabatlar,

00:01:23.740 --> 00:01:27.633
fuqarolik urushi, siyosiy fitna, 
jahongashtalik va

00:01:27.633 --> 00:01:29.088
haddan tashqari 
ko'p Aureliano

00:01:29.088 --> 00:01:30.877
ismli personajlarni